{"seq":4,"slug":"temporal-convolutions","title":"时间卷积网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models/temporal-convolutions","wordCount":977,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"时间卷积网络\">时间卷积网络</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时间卷积网络（Temporal Convolutional Network, TCN）用卷积操作替代循环结构来处理序列数据，在保持因果性（只使用过去信息）的前提下，通过堆叠膨胀因果卷积层获得覆盖整个序列的感受野。TCN 的核心优势是计算的完全并行性和稳定的梯度传播，在许多序列建模任务上达到了与 LSTM 相当甚至更优的性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 膨胀因果卷积&#10;        A[&quot;d=1&lt;br/&gt;感受野=3&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;d=2&lt;br/&gt;感受野=7&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;d=4&lt;br/&gt;感受野=15&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;d=8&lt;br/&gt;感受野=31&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;覆盖整个序列&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 膨胀因果卷积\n        A[\"d=1&lt;br/&gt;感受野=3\"] --&gt; B[\"d=2&lt;br/&gt;感受野=7\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"d=4&lt;br/&gt;感受野=15\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"d=8&lt;br/&gt;感受野=31\"]\n    end\n    D --&gt; E[\"覆盖整个序列\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>RNN/LSTM</th>\n<th>TCN</th>\n<th>Transformer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并行训练</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感受野</td>\n<td>理论无限</td>\n<td>受层数限制</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数共享</td>\n<td>时间步共享</td>\n<td>层内共享</td>\n<td>头内共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果性</td>\n<td>天然满足</td>\n<td>需因果卷积</td>\n<td>需因果掩码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存效率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>推理</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(K \\cdot L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度路径</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"因果卷积\">因果卷积</h2><p>因果卷积确保时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的输出只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 及之前的输入，不会&quot;偷看&quot;未来信息。实现方式是在输入序列左侧填充 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(K-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个零值，使得卷积后的输出长度与输入相同，且每个输出位置只使用了当前及之前的值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class CausalConv1d(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation=1):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.padding = (kernel_size - 1) * dilation&#10;        self.conv = nn.Conv1d(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size,&#10;                              padding=self.padding, dilation=dilation)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        out = self.conv(x)&#10;        if self.padding &gt; 0:&#10;            out = out[:, :, :-self.padding]&#10;        return out\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CausalConv1d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.padding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (kernel_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dilation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv1d(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                              padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.padding, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dilation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dilation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.padding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out[:, :, :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.padding]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out</span></span></code></pre></div><p>朴素因果卷积的感受野随层数线性增长：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 层核大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的因果卷积，感受野为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(K-1) + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。要覆盖长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的序列，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 层，这在计算和参数上都不可接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"膨胀因果卷积\">膨胀因果卷积</h2><p>膨胀（空洞）因果卷积通过在卷积核元素之间插入空洞来指数级扩大感受野。膨胀率按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 2^0, 2^1, 2^2, ...</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span></span></span></span></span> 的指数增长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 层膨胀因果卷积的感受野为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^L \\cdot K - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 层即可覆盖长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的序列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class TCNBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv1 = CausalConv1d(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation)&#10;        self.bn1 = nn.BatchNorm1d(out_channels)&#10;        self.conv2 = CausalConv1d(out_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation)&#10;        self.bn2 = nn.BatchNorm1d(out_channels)&#10;        self.relu = nn.ReLU()&#10;        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(0.2)&#10;        self.downsample = nn.Conv1d(in_channels, out_channels, 1) if in_channels != out_channels else None&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        residual = x if self.downsample is None else self.downsample(x)&#10;        out = self.dropout(self.relu(self.bn1(self.conv1(x))))&#10;        out = self.dropout(self.relu(self.bn2(self.conv2(out))))&#10;        return self.relu(out + residual)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCNBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CausalConv1d(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bn1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.BatchNorm1d(out_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CausalConv1d(out_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, dilation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bn2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.BatchNorm1d(out_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ReLU()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dropout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Dropout(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.downsample </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv1d(in_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.downsample </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.downsample(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dropout(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bn1(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1(x))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dropout(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bn2(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv2(out))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu(out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> residual)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph TCN 残差块&#10;        X[&quot;输入&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;因果卷积 1&lt;br/&gt;+ BN + ReLU&quot;]&#10;        C1 --&gt; C2[&quot;因果卷积 2&lt;br/&gt;+ BN + ReLU&quot;]&#10;        X --&gt; RES[&quot;1×1 卷积&lt;br/&gt;(可选)&quot;]&#10;        C2 --&gt; ADD((&quot;+&quot;))&#10;        RES --&gt; ADD&#10;        ADD --&gt; OUT[&quot;输出&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph TCN 残差块\n        X[\"输入\"] --&gt; C1[\"因果卷积 1&lt;br/&gt;+ BN + ReLU\"]\n        C1 --&gt; C2[\"因果卷积 2&lt;br/&gt;+ BN + ReLU\"]\n        X --&gt; RES[\"1×1 卷积&lt;br/&gt;(可选)\"]\n        C2 --&gt; ADD((\"+\"))\n        RES --&gt; ADD\n        ADD --&gt; OUT[\"输出\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"完整-tcn-架构\">完整 TCN 架构</h2><p>完整的 TCN 由多个残差块堆叠而成，每个块使用不同的膨胀率。标准配置使用核大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，膨胀率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\in \\{1, 2, 4, 8, 16, ...\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class TCN(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, input_size, output_size, num_channels, kernel_size=3):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        layers = []&#10;        num_levels = len(num_channels)&#10;        for i in range(num_levels):&#10;            dilation = 2 ** i&#10;            in_ch = input_size if i == 0 else num_channels[i-1]&#10;            out_ch = num_channels[i]&#10;            layers.append(TCNBlock(in_ch, out_ch, kernel_size, dilation))&#10;        self.network = nn.Sequential(*layers)&#10;        self.linear = nn.Linear(num_channels[-1], output_size)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        x = x.transpose(1, 2)&#10;        y = self.network(x)&#10;        y = y[:, :, -1]&#10;        return self.linear(y)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, input_size, output_size, num_channels, kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        num_levels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_levels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dilation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            in_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_channels[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            out_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_channels[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            layers.append(TCNBlock(in_ch, out_ch, kernel_size, dilation))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.network </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.linear </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(num_channels[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], output_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.transpose(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.network(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y[:, :, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.linear(y)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层数</th>\n<th>膨胀率</th>\n<th>单层感受野</th>\n<th>累计感受野</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>31</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>63</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>65</td>\n<td>127</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>仅 7 层即可覆盖长度 255 的序列，而同样感受野的 LSTM 需要 255 个时间步的逐步传播。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wavenet-与实际应用\">WaveNet 与实际应用</h2><p>WaveNet（2016）是 TCN 思想的经典应用，由 DeepMind 提出用于语音合成。它使用膨胀因果卷积逐样本生成原始音频波形，每个采样点的生成依赖于之前的上千个采样点。WaveNet 的生成质量首次接近自然语音。</p>\n<p>WaveNet 引入了门控激活单元代替简单的 ReLU：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tanh</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>∗</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊙</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>∗</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\tanh(W_{f} * x) \\odot \\sigma(W_{g} * x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tanh</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span></span></span></span></span> 表示因果卷积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊙</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊙</span></span></span></span></span> 表示逐元素乘法。这种门控机制类似于 LSTM 的门控，允许网络控制信息的流通量。</p>\n<p>TCN 在实际应用中的优势场景包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时序预测</strong>：金融数据、气象数据、流量预测，TCN 的并行训练和固定延迟特性非常适合</li>\n<li><strong>动作识别</strong>：视频序列中的时间模式识别，TCN 可以高效处理长时间跨度</li>\n<li><strong>语音处理</strong>：原始波形建模、语音增强、声源分离</li>\n<li><strong>实时系统</strong>：TCN 的推理延迟可精确预测和控制，适合对延迟敏感的在线系统</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((时间卷积网络))&#10;    核心设计&#10;      因果卷积&#10;      膨胀卷积&#10;      残差连接&#10;    关键优势&#10;      并行训练&#10;      对数层感受野&#10;      稳定梯度&#10;    代表应用&#10;      WaveNet 语音合成&#10;      时序预测&#10;      动作识别&#10;    与 RNN 对比&#10;      训练更快&#10;      梯度更稳定&#10;      感受野需设计\">mindmap\n  root((时间卷积网络))\n    核心设计\n      因果卷积\n      膨胀卷积\n      残差连接\n    关键优势\n      并行训练\n      对数层感受野\n      稳定梯度\n    代表应用\n      WaveNet 语音合成\n      时序预测\n      动作识别\n    与 RNN 对比\n      训练更快\n      梯度更稳定\n      感受野需设计</pre><ul>\n<li>TCN 用因果卷积替代循环结构，保证因果性的同时支持完全并行训练</li>\n<li>膨胀因果卷积通过指数增长的膨胀率实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 层覆盖长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的感受野</li>\n<li>残差连接确保深层 TCN 的梯度稳定传播</li>\n<li>WaveNet 是 TCN 的经典应用，通过门控激活实现高质量语音合成</li>\n<li>TCN 在训练速度、梯度稳定性和延迟可控性上优于 RNN，在多数序列任务上性能相当</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时间卷积网络","id":"时间卷积网络"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"因果卷积","id":"因果卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"膨胀因果卷积","id":"膨胀因果卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"完整 TCN 架构","id":"完整-tcn-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"WaveNet 与实际应用","id":"wavenet-与实际应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Seq2Seq 与注意力机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models/seq2seq-attention"},"next":{"title":"图数据表示与编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/graph-representation"}}